   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Muckraker**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Danger Money**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Pill**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Wah Wah [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2015-06-24.matrix.flac1644** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 59 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2015-06-24.matrix.flac1644**: taped by nyctaper; transferred by nyctaper; source: Multitrack Soundboard (engineered and recorded by Harrison Fore) > Harrison mix Wav files + Room mic wav files [1]. Also: Harrison mixed the wav files, which were then processed in Soundforge; The final flac output was tracked using CDWave 1.95 and tagged via Foobar [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2015-06-24 Baby's All Right, Brooklyn, NY, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-june-24-2015-babys-all-right-brooklyn-ny-usa-2.html) [5]",
